.TH DIGITS 1
.SH NAME
digits \- digit memory game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/digits
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Digits
is a digit memory game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
A digit pattern is shown in Tk, then typed back. Wrong guesses end the round; length grows after successes.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B space / Enter
Advance phase / restart after fail
.TP
.B 0-9
Guess next digit
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/digits.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
